sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Nonblocking processing and completion
  accDescr: A queued receipt opens a processing route without blocking navigation. Independent processing commits a report, notice and event. The relay, Valkey and ASGI delivery path signals an authorized read; only the same processing route advances.
  participant UI as React
  participant API as Django API
  participant P as Worker + PostgreSQL
  participant D as Event delivery
  UI->>API: 1–2 Submit comparison
  API-->>UI: 202 queued + job ID
  UI->>UI: Open processing route<br/>Navigation stays available
  P->>P: 6 Commit report + notice<br/>+ durable event
  P->>D: 7a Pending owner revision
  D->>D: 7b Relay → Valkey wake<br/>7c ASGI gateway → durable replay
  D-->>UI: SSE IDs + revision
  UI->>API: 7d Affected authorized reads
  API-->>UI: Saved job / inbox / source state
  alt Same active processing route
    UI->>UI: Success → saved result
  else Other route or draft
    UI->>UI: Update inbox<br/>Preserve route / draft / focus
  end
  Note over UI,P: Closed browser recovers saved notices on next visit
